{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>They are whole with us.</b> The men of the city had thought that they hated them, for they saw them grieved and it angered them greatly, and perhaps they were being guarded against them, with bars and doors placed in their city, for they were mighty men, men of valor in battle. And now they said to them: Do not fear and do not keep distant from them, for with a whole heart they are with us."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:39:24.301821706Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}